  <uni.:hasOutcome rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate competence in a set of transferable skills, including (but not limited to) digital literacy, information management, research skills and critical thinking, as well as an ability to manage and take responsibility for their own learning processes with minimum guidance</uni.:hasOutcome>
