  <uni.:hasOutcome rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate an increased level of competency in all four macro skills—listening to, speaking, reading and writing German—corresponding to proficiency Level A2 and above of the Common European Framework of Reference for Languages</uni.:hasOutcome>
  <uni.:hasOutcome rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate an increased awareness of intercultural understanding and of language learning, as well as research skills and communication strategies.</uni.:hasOutcome>
