  <uni.:hasOutcome rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">create a proposal and final report with the approval of the host supervisor</uni.:hasOutcome>
  <uni.:hasOutcome rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">perform tasks set by an employer to a high standard</uni.:hasOutcome>
  <uni.:hasOutcome rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate high level of initiative and the ability to work independently where required</uni.:hasOutcome>
  <uni.:hasOutcome rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">critically reflect on experience in the workplace.</uni.:hasOutcome>
  <uni.:hasOutcome rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">apply communication and interpersonal skills to a working situation</uni.:hasOutcome>
