  <uni.:hasOutcome rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">read and write in Spanish with accuracy and fluency at B1-B2 Level of the Common European Framework of Reference for Languages</uni.:hasOutcome>
  <uni.:hasOutcome rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">converse in Spanish with fluency and accuracy on contemporary themes</uni.:hasOutcome>
