  <uni.:hasOutcome rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">demonstrate an understanding of various macroeconomic models for analysing issues such as unemployment, inflation, growth and open economy.</uni.:hasOutcome>
  <uni.:hasOutcome rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">explain how equilibrium is determined in the goods and financial markets in a closed economy and</uni.:hasOutcome>
