  <uni.:hasOutcome rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">research a chosen neuroscience topic in depth and deliver a seminar on that topic.</uni.:hasOutcome>
  <uni.:hasOutcome rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">recall and integrate key knowledge and concepts about</uni.:hasOutcome>
